#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Take a 20-question exam on the IBM Training site to test your skills in practical quantum computing, and receive a badge through Credly."
msgstr "Ikuti ujian 20 soal di situs IBM Training untuk menguji keterampilan Anda dalam komputasi kuantum praktis, dan dapatkan badge melalui Credly."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Exam | Quantum computing in practice"
msgstr "Ujian | Komputasi kuantum dalam praktik"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Exam and badge {#exam-and-badge}"
msgstr "Ujian dan badge {#exam-and-badge}"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![A square badge stating the name of this course, foundational level, and issued by IBM Quantum&reg;.](/learning/images/courses/quantum-computing-in-practice/exam/badge.avif)\n"
msgstr "![A square badge stating the name of this course, foundational level, and issued by IBM Quantum&reg;.](/learning/images/courses/quantum-computing-in-practice/exam/badge.avif)\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Post-course survey {#post-course-survey}"
msgstr "Survei pasca-kursus {#post-course-survey}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Congratulations on completing the \"Quantum computing in practice\" course by IBM&reg;!\n"
msgstr "Selamat telah menyelesaikan kursus \"Quantum computing in practice\" dari IBM&reg;!\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Test your knowledge {#test-your-knowledge}"
msgstr "Uji pengetahuan Anda {#test-your-knowledge}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "After completing the reading and activities in this course, click the button below to navigate to IBM Training, where you can take the badging exam for Quantum computing in practice.\n"
msgstr "Setelah menyelesaikan bacaan dan aktivitas dalam kursus ini, klik tombol di bawah untuk menuju ke IBM Training, tempat Anda dapat mengikuti ujian badging untuk Quantum computing in practice.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The exam consists of 20 questions, and you must answer at least 16 correctly to pass. Upon receiving a passing score, your badge will automatically be sent to the email you used to register with IBM Training.\n"
msgstr "Ujian terdiri dari 20 soal, dan Anda harus menjawab setidaknya 16 soal dengan benar untuk lulus. Setelah mendapatkan skor kelulusan, badge Anda akan secara otomatis dikirimkan ke email yang Anda gunakan untuk mendaftar di IBM Training.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Make sure you're ready to take the exam. If you don't receive a passing score in two attempts, the exam becomes temporarily locked.\n"
msgstr "Pastikan Anda siap untuk mengikuti ujian. Jika Anda tidak mendapatkan skor kelulusan dalam dua kali percobaan, ujian akan terkunci sementara.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<LaunchExamButton href=\"https://www.ibm.com/training/course/quantum-computing-in-practice-DL46111G\" />\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "NOTICE: IBM leverages the services of Credly, a third-party data processor authorized by IBM and located in the United States, to assist in the administration of the IBM Digital Badge program. In order to issue you an IBM Digital Badge, your personal information (name, email address, and badge earned) will be shared with Credly. You will receive an email notification from Credly with instructions for claiming the badge. Your personal information is used to issue your badge and for program reporting and operational purposes. IBM may share the personal information collected with IBM subsidiaries and third parties globally. It will be handled in a manner consistent with IBM privacy practices. The IBM Privacy Statement can be viewed [here](https://www.ibm.com/privacy/us/en/).\n"
msgstr "PEMBERITAHUAN: IBM memanfaatkan layanan Credly, pemroses data pihak ketiga yang diberi wewenang oleh IBM dan berlokasi di Amerika Serikat, untuk membantu administrasi program IBM Digital Badge. Untuk menerbitkan IBM Digital Badge kepada Anda, informasi pribadi Anda (nama, alamat email, dan badge yang diperoleh) akan dibagikan dengan Credly. Anda akan menerima pemberitahuan email dari Credly dengan instruksi untuk mengklaim badge tersebut. Informasi pribadi Anda digunakan untuk menerbitkan badge Anda dan untuk keperluan pelaporan dan operasional program. IBM dapat membagikan informasi pribadi yang dikumpulkan dengan anak perusahaan IBM dan pihak ketiga secara global. Informasi ini akan ditangani dengan cara yang konsisten dengan praktik privasi IBM. Pernyataan Privasi IBM dapat dilihat [di sini](https://www.ibm.com/privacy/us/en/).\n"
